        "end_line": 2844,
        "verbatim_source": "Kontakion of the Temple, Glory: Kontakion to the Forerunner, Both now: \"O protection\"; if the temple is of the Theotokos, then after the Kontakion to the Forerunner – Glory, and now: Kontakion of the Temple. After \"More honorable\" – three great prostrations, and also \"O All-Holy Trinity\" and dismissal."
      }
