      "slavonic_text": "",
      "english_text": "Katavasia after the 3rd, 8th and 9th[^395] – Heirmos of the three-ode canon, and after the 6th – Heirmos of the Forefeast, because it is – the last canon. After the 3rd ode – Kontakion of the Forefeast and Sessional hymn of the Cross, Glory, and now: of the Forefeast; after the 6th – Kontakion-Ikos of the Cross; after the 9th – Lenten Triadikon Exaposteilarion of the tone; and also of the Cross with its Cross-Theotokion[^396].",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "Translation/Liturgical Monuments/Monument 0 - 2010 Lviv Typikon/Final/Final_Dolnytsky_part3_menaion.txt",
        "source_sha256": "11a90d1b65ff68f72063b09b621fe3fb274c225385b0e88d1c1596d0b2a4f302",
        "source_format": "TEXT_LINES",
        "start_line": 3122,
        "end_line": 3122,
        "verbatim_source": "Katavasia after the 3rd, 8th and 9th[^395] – Heirmos of the three-ode canon, and after the 6th – Heirmos of the Forefeast, because it is – the last canon. After the 3rd ode – Kontakion of the Forefeast and Sessional hymn of the Cross, Glory, and now: of the Forefeast; after the 6th – Kontakion-Ikos of the Cross; after the 9th – Lenten Triadikon Exaposteilarion of the tone; and also of the Cross with its Cross-Theotokion[^396]."
      }
    },
